cix-npu-driver (6.2.0-1+zv3.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Load on firmware without an SCMI perf domain: devfreq is optional.
  * Install the UAPI header as /usr/include/misc/armchina_aipu.h.
  * Drop the EXTRA_CFLAGS lines kbuild no longer reads, and the deprecated
    dkms CLEAN= directive.

 -- Leonardo Marques <leonardo.j.marques@gmail.com>  Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:30:00 +0100

cix-npu-driver (6.2.0-1+zv3.1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Zhouyi V3 / CIX Sky1 build of the CIX 6.2.0-1 driver: code for other
    architectures and SoCs removed, probe/teardown/IRQ/ioctl hardening,
    buffer ownership checks, retire-on-drain completion, report-only job
    deadline, zero-copy weight ioctls (WBUF/SLOT, 30-34).
  * Builds on 6.6.x-cix kernels as well as 7.0.

 -- Leonardo Marques <leonardo.j.marques@gmail.com>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100

